Hi Ahmed,

Several years ago I took the MRQAP workshop with David Dekker at Sunbelt
and he showed us how to you could partition your matrix by column/row so
that you would only permute your outcome matrix within partitions and not
between them. It seems to me that if you have your three courses as
unconnected sub-graphs within one network you could make use of such
partitioning so that you permute within classes, but not among them. I
cannot find the sample code that David gave us in the workshop, but perhaps
you can reach out to him and ask if he can share the code he uses in his
workshops.

Best wishes
Jesse Sayles

